2:T491,<br><h2>Voice of a <span class="ident">Pirate</span> on CBBC</h2>
<p>Yarr! You be looking for an authentic Pirate Voiceover?<br>
Inspiration taken from Captain Barbossa of the Disney Pirates of the Caribbean Movies.<br>
Listen to the Pirate showreel or watch it in action.</p>

<p>You may also recognise Guy from roles such as the 
<a href="/pop-up-pirate-voiceover" title="Pop-Up Pirate Voiceover">Pop-Up Pirate voice</a> 
and the swashbuckling star of 
<a href="/playmobil-pirate-voice" title="Playmobil Pirate Voice">Playmobil Pirate World</a>. 
From children’s TV to toy commercials, his pirate performances truly bring the seven seas to life.</p>

<p>A CBBC Pirate or the voice of Pirate Bridge — the director was so happy Guy didn’t have to walk the plank!</p>

